1336	    // activated branches; the run completes once nothing can still run.
1337	    // Snapshot the result at this end node's own execution moment: the
1338	    // recorded value is this run's independent copy, so later mutation of
1339	    // the definition's result (during a wait on another activated branch),
1340	    // of another run's result, or of the returned value cannot reach back
1341	    // here. Validation already guarantees cloneability, so this cannot
1342	    // throw mid-run. An unset or null result stays null; 0, false and ""
